{
	"name": "Discombobulate",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/daggers/knife-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>While anyone in the world can aim for the head to try and disorient their opponent, those with a knowledge of where nerves lie and the position of the middle ear are more adept at it. As part of your attack action, you may make an attack with a bludgeoning weapon or unarmed attack to force your target to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, they are [[/condition id=confused]] for a number of rounds equal to your Intelligence modifier. They may repeat the save at the end of each of their turns.</p>",
